#flow2 guide: FLOW_GUIDE.md in this folder | N:id[@grp] shape[.fmt] color x y w h text | E:from>to[/opts] label
# Visual reference: FLOW_GUIDE.png is this file rendered by the app. Each node's text names its own line.
h1 text.l k 0 -80 - - **1. Shapes** (node text = shape)
s1 rect w 0 0 176 120 rect
s2 round T 224 0 176 120 round
s3 pill r 448 36 200 48 pill
s4 circle Y 696 0 120 120 circle
s5 diamond N 864 0 140 120 diamond
s6 db B 1052 20 80 80 db
s7 text k 1180 44 - - text
s8 table w 1340 0 320 120 table|cells\nrow 2|split by \|
h2 text.l k 0 180 - - **2. Colors** (lowercase = strong, UPPERCASE = light, - = none, #hex = custom)
