d@g2 rect n 40 64 180 80 d@g2
m@g1 rect.<W w 40 300 480 180 **bold** ~~strike~~ normal\n- bullet one\n- bullet two
h7 text.l k 1600 1460 - - **7. Groups** (&lg1,lg2,lg3 = all three move together; &lg1,lg2 nested inside it)
lg1 rect B 1600 1520 160 64 lg1
lg2 rect B 1800 1520 160 64 lg2
lg3 rect B 2000 1520 160 64 lg3
h8 text.l k 1600 1660 - - **8. Comments and h -** (see the # line above node ah in the text)
# a comment: the app keeps it attached to the line below
ah rect T 1600 1720 360 - ah: h is - so the app measures this text at w 360 and writes the real height into the file
&lg1,lg2,lg3
&lg1,lg2
e1>f1 (no opts) curved
e2>f2/| /| elbow
